{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-3-29","kind":"proposition","title":"等圆之圆分等则其割圆分之直线亦等","englishTitle":"In equal circles equal circumferences are subtended by equal straight lines.","book":3,"number":29,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.29","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.29/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":29,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷三"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-3-29@raw-0c853e4713bedf07","contentId":"euclid-3-29","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0c853e4713bedf070a2721b2ba5d922edd2e4b8a727630e10a32e4706c6e503c","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-3-29.statement","euclid-3-29.construction.1","euclid-3-29.construction.2","euclid-3-29.proof.1","euclid-3-29.proof.2","euclid-3-29.conclusion","euclid-3-29.historical.1","euclid-3-29.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-3-29.statement","contentId":"euclid-3-29","revisionId":"euclid-3-29@raw-0c853e4713bedf07","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c28ffbd50d64836e8f260e64410e8c73a6ba42ffc72f4ab9e8d15b383e6d9d52","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"In equal circles equal circumferences are subtended by equal straight lines."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在平等圈子中,相同的环绕由相同的直线加以调整。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"等圜之圜分等则其割圜分之直线亦等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果相等圆的弧相等，那么切割圆的弧所对应的直线也相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-29.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-3-29","revisionId":"euclid-3-29@raw-0c853e4713bedf07","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"12fa2dd7b5d0f1ba19db6fc8c6c1a169ed12c99a1a1001dd222ad5f9eeaab2f0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABC, DEF be equal circles, and in them let equal circumferences BGC, EHF be cut off; and let the straight lines BC, EF be joined; I say that BC is equal to EF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABC,DEF成为平等的圈子,让BGC,EHF等宽线被切断;让BC,EF直线连接起来;我说BC等于EF。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-29.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-3-29","revisionId":"euclid-3-29@raw-0c853e4713bedf07","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9a0c4e6e79ba3958eec7f59f39ba5da5efafa4a3d682d9f847a6694e059f97c7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the centres of the circles be taken, and let them be K, L; let BK, KC, EL, LF be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将圈子的中心 放在K,L之间 BK,KC,EL,LF连接起来"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-29.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-3-29","revisionId":"euclid-3-29@raw-0c853e4713bedf07","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8b30777fcd8720f412beb5eb295519ec241061ed365c4eafd5d53e2132b7db9f","citations":["euclid-3-27"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since the circumference BGC is equal to the circumference EHF, the angle BKC is also equal to the angle ELF. [[III. 27](/principles/euclid-3-27)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,由于环形BGC等于环形EHF,角度BKC也等于角度ELF。 [[III. 27](/principles/euclid-3-27)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-29.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-3-29","revisionId":"euclid-3-29@raw-0c853e4713bedf07","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cb7fa911f2d5d405375631714647d77615392f50ca0b1a78e2bfd54fac5f1658","citations":["euclid-1-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the circles ABC, DEF are equal, the radii are also equal; therefore the two sides BK, KC are equal to the two sides EL, LF; and they contain equal angles; therefore the base BC is equal to the base EF. [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于圆圈ABC,DEF是平等的, 弧度也是平等的; 因此,两边BK,KC是平等的, EL,LF; 它们包含相同的角度; 因此, 底边,BC 等于 底边,EF。 [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-29.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-3-29","revisionId":"euclid-3-29@raw-0c853e4713bedf07","order":5,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d0def46992eb0b105b82d6bce6477450c524a884c436026a0e1ed896becf6c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此命题得证。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-29.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-3-29","revisionId":"euclid-3-29@raw-0c853e4713bedf07","order":6,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"25df8697fb0a111a3a9f2da9c16a167a008f9a67a69a3626f950ccb2e00d6e30","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"等圜之圜分等则其割圜分之直线亦等解曰依前题两圜之甲乙丙丁戊己两圜分等而甲丙丁己两圜分亦等题言甲丙丁己两线必等论曰依前题作四线其甲庚丙角形之甲庚庚丙两腰与丁辛己角形之丁辛辛己两腰等而庚辛两角所乘之甲丙丁己两圜分等即庚辛两角亦等〈本篇廿七〉而对等角之甲丙丁己两线必等〈一卷四〉注曰第二十六至二十九四题所说俱等圜其在同圜亦依此论"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果圆的弧相等，那么切割弧的线也相等。解释如下：根据前一个问题，两个圆 甲乙丙丁戊己 的两条弧相等，甲丙丁己 的两条弧也相等。命题 甲丙丁己 的解释：这两条线必须相等。两条线的证明如下：根据前一个问题，三角形 丁辛己 的两条边 甲庚丙 和 甲庚庚丙 以及 丁辛辛己 相等，庚辛 乘以的两弧也相等，即 庚辛 和 庚辛 有两个相等的角 〈本篇廿七〉，而对相等角的两条线 甲丙丁己 必须相等。注意 〈一卷四〉 注：问题 26 到 294 都是相等的圆，同样适用于同一个圆。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-29.source","contentId":"euclid-3-29","revisionId":"euclid-3-29@raw-0c853e4713bedf07","order":7,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f91eb75ce7922c379b68b7921ef38e830232841b79f82f9003daea274584d16c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.29/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.29\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷三"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-3-29:euclid-3-27:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-29","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-29.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-27","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.29","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.29/","sourceLabel":"III. 27"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-3-29:euclid-1-4:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-29","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-29.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-4","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.29","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.29/","sourceLabel":"I. 4"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-4-11:euclid-3-29:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-4-11","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-4-11.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-29","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.11","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.11/","sourceLabel":"III. 29"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-4-15:euclid-3-29:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-4-15","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-4-15.proof.11"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-29","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.15","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.15/","sourceLabel":"III. 29"}}],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-3-29:euclid-3-27:explicit","id":"euclid-3-27","book":3,"number":27,"kind":"proposition","title":"等圆之角所乘圆分等则其角或在心或在界俱等","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-3-29:euclid-1-4:explicit","id":"euclid-1-4","book":1,"number":4,"kind":"proposition","title":"三角形全等：两边及其夹角相等","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-4-11:euclid-3-29:explicit","id":"euclid-4-11","book":4,"number":11,"kind":"proposition","title":"圆内接正五边形的尺规作图","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-4-15:euclid-3-29:explicit","id":"euclid-4-15","book":4,"number":15,"kind":"proposition","title":"圆内接正六边形的尺规作图","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-circle","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":